  aciklama:
  - "Pek z\xE2t-\u0131 muhterem biri oldu\u011Fun, telvelerinde beliren ve uyand\u0131rd\u0131\u011F\u0131
    asil intibayla yukar\u0131lardan sarkan bir kadife ip fig\xFCr\xFCnden a\u015Fik\xE2r
    Say\u0131n {{soyisim}}. Bu kadifemsi ip, fincan\u0131n\u0131n a\u015Fa\u011F\u0131
    kesimlerine do\u011Fru sanki fraktallara yay\u0131lm\u0131\u015F gibi g\xF6r\xFCnen
    telvelerine do\u011Fru uzan\u0131yor. Son derece \xF6zg\xFCn bir \xF6r\xFCnt\xFC
    halinde \u015Fekillenen bu g\xF6r\xFCnt\xFC, \xE7ok k\u0131ymetli i\xE7g\xF6r\xFCler
    ve deneyimlerle bezenmi\u015F hayat\u0131n\u0131n kalan\u0131n\u0131 marazi psikolojik
    ve bedensel durumlardan ar\u0131nm\u0131\u015F bir \u015Fekilde s\xFCrd\xFCrece\u011Finin
    delaleti."
